  challenge: "Search for '[your county name] recorder transfer tax' and find the actual published rate for your address, including any city-level tax. Then calculate the tax on a purchase price you are realistically considering, and find out the local custom on who pays. Write both on the same line in your closing-cost budget. This is a ten-minute task that regularly moves a closing budget by thousands of dollars.",
